  "title": "MOOSE is a cutting-edge, data-centric AI solution for Total-Body research",
  "summary": "Built on the robust nn-UNet framework, MOOSE can identify 120 unique tissue classes from whole-body 18F-FDG PET/CT images, accepting inputs as either combined PET/CT images or CT-only images.MOOSE offers a wide range of segmentation models catering to various clinical and preclinical needs: • Lungs • Organs • Body • Ribs • Muscles • Peripheral bones • All bones • Fat • Vertebrae • Cardiac • Digestive • Brain • LegsHarness the full potential of total-body PET with MOOSE.Enquire now",
